<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The experience of being an adoptive parent to a child or children. An adoptive parent is the person or persons who become permanent parents through adoption with all the responsibilities therein." .
