<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000026> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Institutions dedicated to education, prevention, and treatment of HIV/AIDS; AIDS information centers often provide services like HIV counseling and testing services." .
