<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000032" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "AIDS phobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Serofobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "AIDSphobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fear of AIDS" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fobia al SIDA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "AIDSfobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Miedo al SIDA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sidafobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sidofobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed toward individuals with HIV/AIDS or behaviors perceived as putting oneself at risk for contracting HIV/AIDS. AIDS phobia may include isolation, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia personas con VIH/SIDA o hacia comportamientos percibidos como riesgosos en relación a la contracción de VIH/SIDA. La fobia al SIDA puede incluir el aislamiento, los estereotipos, el acoso verbal y la violencia física." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000005> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88004490> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSPhobia> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000032> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
