<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Native American Mohave tribes, people assigned male at birth who exhibit feminine traits and could become socially female, often serving as healers." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En las tribus nativas americanas mohave, las personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer que exhiben rasgos femeninos y pueden convertirse socialmente en mujeres, a menudo sirviendo como curanderos." .
