<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000064" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aphallia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Afalia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Penile agenesis" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People with aphallia have XY chromosomes, testes, and are born without a penis. They produce typical levels of testosterone, and they develop secondary sex characteristics associated with a typical testosterone puberty during adolescence." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Las personas con afalia tienen cromosomas XY, testículos y nacen sin pene. Producen niveles típicos de testosterona y desarrollan características sexuales secundarias asociadas a una pubertad típica con testosterona durante la adolescencia." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000669> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000064> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/aphallia> .
