<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indian term for people who identify as women trapped in male bodies; many prefer other terms, such as hijra or thirunangai." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término indio para personas que seautoidentificancomo mujeres atrapadas en cuerpos masculinos; muches prefieren otros términos, como hijra o thirunangai." .
