<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000085> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A romanized version of the Hebrew term traditionally used in Judaism to describe people assigned female at birth who develop secondary-sex characteristics perceived as \"male\" as well as fertility issues." .
