<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000092> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A subculture that emerged in early 20th century New York City in which primarily African-American and Latin American LGBTQ+ people perform and compete for various prizes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000092> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Subcultura surgida en la ciudad de Nueva York a principios del siglo XX en la que personas LGBTQ+ principalmente afroamericanas y latinoamericanas actúan y compiten por diversos premios." .
