<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Silicone, rubber, or other types of balls that are strapped in a person’s mouth to prevent them from speaking, typically during sex." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pelotas de silicona, goma u otros materiales atadas a la boca de una persona para impedirle hablar, usualmente durante el sexo." .
