<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000094" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ballroom families" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Familias de ballroom" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ballroom houses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Casas de ballroom" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In ball culture, ballroom families (or houses) are chosen families headed by and named after established community members (e.g., the House of Xtravaganza); heads of ballroom families are typically called \"mothers\" or \"fathers,\" while members are termed \"children\" and \"siblings.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En la cultura del baile, las familias (o casas) de ballroom son familias elegidas encabezadas por miembros establecidos de la comunidad y que reciben su nombre de ellos (por ejemplo, la Casa de Xtravaganza); a los cabezas de familia de baile se les suele llamar \"madres\" o \"padres\", mientras que a los miembros se les denomina \"hijos\" y \"hermanos\"." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000092> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000834> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000371> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/ballroomFamilies> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
