<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Banjees" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000095> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term from the 1980s (or earlier) that describes a certain type of young Latin American or African American man who has sex with men and who dresses in stereotypical masculine urban fashion." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000095> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término de la década de 1980 (o anterior) que describe a un determinado tipo de joven latino o afroamericano que mantiene relaciones sexuales con hombres y que viste de forma estereotipada masculina y urbana." .
