<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ love" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Love (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Amor LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Amor (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Strong feelings of affection arising out of kinship, personal ties, or intimate relationships between two or more LGBTQ+ people. Can be used to describe the particularities of love as experienced by LGBTQ+ people in a given culture, as well as the ways love is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fuertes sentimientos de afecto que surgen del parentesco, los vínculos personales o las relaciones íntimas entre dos o más personas LGBTQ+. Puede utilizarse para describir las particularidades del amor experimentado por las personas LGBTQ+ en una cultura determinada, así como las formas en que se discute y expresa el amor dentro de las comunidades LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000921> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000957> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000108" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bi+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas bi+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who are not exclusively sexually and/or romantically attracted to individuals of a single biological sex (includes bisexual, queer, pansexual, and fluid identities)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que no sienten una atracción sexual y/o romántica exclusiva por personas de un único sexo biológico (incluye las identidades bisexuales, queer, pansexuales y fluidas)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
