<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000112> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unwillingness to accept or affirm LGBTQ+ people or their identities in attitude or practice." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000112> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Renuencia a aceptar o afirmar a las personas LGBTQ+ o sus identidades en actitud o en práctica." .
