<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000113> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tagalog term for individuals who possess both male and female traits." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000113> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término tagalog para designar a una persona con rasgos tanto masculinos como femeninos." .
