<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000166> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Serialized print or digital periodicals created by or for bisexual people, often with the purpose of sharing news and information related to bisexual communities and bisexual issues." .
