<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Padres bisexuales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000170> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who are romantically and/or sexually attracted to more than one gender and who identify as bisexual; do not use to describe pansexual or polysexual people unless they also use the term bisexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000170> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Padres y/o madres que son bisexuales." .
