<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Blogs" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ blogs" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Blogs LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Websites or webpages, typically run by individuals or small groups, that are written in an informal or conversational style." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sitios web o páginas web, generalmente administradas por individuos o grupos pequeños, escritas en un estilo informal o conversacional." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Websites featuring informal, often personal writing and reflections created by LGBTQ+ people or about LGBTQ+ communities and issues." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sitios web que presentan escritos y reflexiones informales, a menudo personales, creados por personas LGBTQ+ o sobre comunidades y cuestiones LGBTQ+." .
