<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Peer support for LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Pares" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cuidado entre pares LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000226> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A peer-to-peer form of healthcare support for LGBTQ+ people in which volunteers (sometimes called buddies) attend clinical visits with patients to provide emotional and logistical support." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000226> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de apoyo entre pares para cuidados de salud para personas LGBTQ+ en la que voluntarios (amigos) asisten a visitas clínicas con pacientes para brindarles apoyo emocional y logístico." .
