<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Casual sex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sexo casual" .
