<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000252> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000252" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Chest harnesses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Arneses de pecho" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Arneses pectorales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000252> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wearable accessories, typically consisting of leather straps and metal rings or points of attachment, that fit around the chest and shoulders like a vest. May be worn as a fashion statement, to signal one's belonging to the leather or BDSM communities, or to restrict the wearer's movement during sex." .
