<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ Latinx" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Latinas (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Latinos (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Latine people (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Latinx people (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Latinas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Latine people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Latinos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Latinx people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Latin American people who are LGBTQ+; only use to describe individuals who self-identify as Latino, Latina, or Latinx. Do not conflate with Chicano/a/x or Hispanic." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000253> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas latinoamericanas que son LGBTQ+; utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifican como latinos, latinas o latinxs. No debe confundirse con chicano/a/x o hispano/a/x." .
