<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000296> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal framework in which two partners are considered married without having formally registered their relationship as a civil or religious marriage. Common law marriage grants certain economic rights and legal privileges. " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000296> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marco jurídico en el que dos cónyuges se consideran casados ​​sin haber registrado formalmente su relación como matrimonio civil o religioso. El matrimonio de hecho otorga ciertos derechos económicos y privilegios legales." .
