<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000350> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bengali term for third sex people, often referring to feminine people who were assigned male at birth." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000350> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término bengalí para personas del tercer sexo, que a menudo se refiere a personas femeninas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer." .
