<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Discriminación LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Discrimination (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Discriminación (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The unjust or prejudicial treatment of LGBTQ+ people or communities due to their sexual or gender identities; may include the denial of legal rights, employment, and housing." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El trato injusto o perjudicial hacia personas o comunidades LGBTQ+ debido a sus identidades sexuales o de género; puede incluir la negación de derechos legales, empleo y vivienda." .
