<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ D-types" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Dommes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ Mistresses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person who takes on the position of authority or power in a power exchange relationship or kink activity. Most commonly used by feminine identified people and professional dominants." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000363> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mujeres que desempeñan un papel dominante en las actividades de BDSM; utilícese para dominatrices que se autoidentifiquen como LGBTQ+." .
