<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000364> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who donate their own biological materials, typically gametes (e.g., sperm or eggs), organs, or blood." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000364> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que donan sus propios materiales biológicos, normalmente gametos (p. ej., esperma u óvulos), órganos o sangre." .
