<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people who use substances" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Drug users (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ people who drink" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ people who use drugs" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Substance users (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term for LGBTQ+ people who use substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) for any reason. Apply more specific terms if possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término general para las personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias (que suelen ser consideradas nocivas o están sujetas a restricciones legales, como las drogas o el alcohol) por cualquier motivo. Aplique términos más específicos de ser posible." .
