<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000382> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000383" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dyke demonstrations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Marcha de las bolleras" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dyke marches" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dyke rallies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dyke protests" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Marchas dyke" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Marchas de lesbianas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against dykes and advocate for dyke visibility, rights, and issues. This term should only be used to describe demonstrations explicitly for lesbians who identify as dykes or that are centered on the dyke identity and politics. Otherwise, use the more general term \"Lesbian demonstrations.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marchas, protestas y otros encuentros centrados en la visibilidad, los asuntos y los derechos de las lesbianas. Utilícese únicamente para describir marchas explícitamente a favor de las bolleras o centradas en la identidad y la política de las bolleras. De lo contrario, utilícese el término más general \"marchas de lesbianas\"." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003934> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003206> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000006> .
