<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Electroshock therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Terapia de electroshock" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Electric shock therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Electroconvulsive therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Terapia de electro shock" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Terapia electroconvulsiva" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of psychiatric treatment for major depression, bipolar depression, and other mental health conditions that usually consists of brief electrical pulses to the brain through electrodes on the head that induce controlled seizures. Electroshock therapy has historically been used as an attempt to \"cure\" homosexuality and other non-normative sexualities and sexual practices." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de tratamiento psiquiátrico para la depresión mayor, la depresión bipolar y otras condiciones de salud mental que generalmente consiste de breves pulsos eléctricos al cerebro a través de electrodos en la cabeza que inducen convulsiones controladas. Históricamente, la terapia de electroshock se ha utilizado como un intento para \"curar\" la homosexualidad y otras sexualidades y prácticas sexuales no normativas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001366> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000349> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85041999> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001004> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000394> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/electroshockTherapy> .
