<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000404> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000404" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eroticism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Erotismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The quality of being erotic, or causing sexual attraction, arousal, or desire. " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000404> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La cualidad de ser erótico, o causar atracción, excitación o deseo sexual." .
