<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000949> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sporting and cultural event open to anyone regardless of sexual identity or qualifying standards that is intended to bring together athletes and artists from around the globe, many from countries where homosexuality remains illegal; separate from the Gay Games" .
