<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Faes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Queer people who are involved with or identify with the countercultural movement seeking to redefine queer consciousness through secular spirituality. Often but not always associated with the Radical Faeries, a loosely affiliated worldwide network that formed in the 1970s." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas queer que están involucradas o se autoidentifican con el movimiento contracultural que busca redefinir la conciencia queer a través de la espiritualidad secular. A menudo, pero no siempre, se asocia con Radical Faeries, una red mundial libremente afiliada que se formó en la década de 1970." .
