<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000418> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Slur used chiefly in North America to refer to gay men (or, in some cases, LGBTQ+ people in general). Some gay men have reclaimed this term and use it to describe themselves." .
