<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000430" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Female genital mutilation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mutilación genital femenina" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of cutting or removing the female genitals, sometimes to control sexual drive or punish lesbianism." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica que consiste en cortar o extirpar los genitales femeninos, a veces, para controlar el impulso sexual o castigar el lesbianismo." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000281> .
