<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitución femenina" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trabajo sexual femenino" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000433> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Women who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe women working across the broad spectrum of sex work." .
