<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relaciones lésbicas-gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gay-lesbian relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Relaciones gay-lésbicas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Connections between individuals and communities of lesbians and gay men, including historic and ongoing solidarity, advocacy, and activism." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conexiones entre personas y comunidades de lesbianas y hombres gay, incluida la solidaridad, la incidencia política y el activismo histórico y continuo." .
