<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000504" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Same-sex marriage" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matrimonio entre personas del mismo sexo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gay marriage" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lesbian marriage" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Matrimonio gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Matrimonio lesbiana" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal union between two people of the same sex who are in a partnership. In the United States, same-sex marriage differs from civil unions in that the former is recognized at the federal level, whereas the latter is only recognized at the state level and may not be recognized by other states." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unión jurídica entre dos personas del mismo sexo que forman una pareja. En los Estados Unidos, el matrimonio entre personas del mismo sexo se diferencia de las uniones civiles en que el primero se reconoce a nivel federal, mientras que el segundo sólo se reconoce a nivel estatal y puede no ser reconocido por otros estados." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000990> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000844> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001514> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh92003901> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000973> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/same-sexMarriage> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
