<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gay men" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Amos gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gays" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Men who self-identify as gay and belong to gay communities. Predominately used to describe men who are exclusively or primarily romantically and/or sexually attracted to other men. While \"gay\" is often used as an identifier by people of all genders, this term specifically refers to gay men." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hombres gay que forman parte de la escena BDSM y asumen el rol de amos en las relaciones sexuales con una dinámica amo/esclavo." .
