<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000533" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gay sensibility" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sensibilidad gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A way of reading and looking at cultural texts (books, movies, television, magazines, etc.) through a gay lens, often including the appropriation of texts otherwise thought of as heterosexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de leer y mirar textos culturales (libros, películas, televisión, revistas, etc.) a través de un lente gay, a menudo incluyendo la apropiación de textos que, de lo contrario, se considerarían heterosexuales." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySensibility> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000534" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gay shame" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vergüenza gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Movement within queer communities that is described as a radical alternative to gay culture being brought into the mainstream; directly posits an alternative view of gay pride events and activities that rejects increasing commercialization, corporate sponsors, and \"safer\" agendas to avoid offending heterosexual supporters and sponsors." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Movimiento dentro de comunidades queer que se describe como una alternativa radical a la incorporación de la cultura gay a la corriente principal; postula directamente una visión alternativa a los eventos y actividades del orgullo gay que rechaza su creciente comercialización, los patrocinadores corporativos y las agendas \"más seguras\" que evitan ofender a partidarios y patrocinadores heterosexuales." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000006> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001561> .
