<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000537> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Groups of gay men formed for the purpose of playing sports; includes professional and amateur sports clubs." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000537> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grupos de hombres gay formados con el fin de practicar deportes; incluye clubes deportivos profesionales y amateurs." .
