<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alianzas Gay-Heterosexual" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "GSAs" .
