<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbians" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbianas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gay women" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lesbian women" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lesbian people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Mujeres gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas lesbianas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Mujeres lesbianas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who self-identify as lesbian and belong to lesbian communities. The term has been predominately used to describe women who are exclusively or primarily romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que se identifican como lesbianas y pertenecen a comunidades lesbianas. El término se ha utilizado predominantemente para describir a mujeres que se sienten exclusiva o principalmente atraídas romántica y/o sexualmente por otras mujeres. Sin embargo, no todas las lesbianas son mujeres, y las personas disidentes de género que pertenecen a comunidades lésbicas a menudo se han identificado como lesbianas." .
