<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000557> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on gay characters or themes." .
