<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000562" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender bending" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgresión de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of transgressing or \"bending\" expected gender roles, which often involves adopting or exaggerating stereotypically feminine or masculine traits to expose them as artificial. Gender bending is similar to drag, though drag is often associated with artistic or stage performances, whereas gender bending is typically enacted in everyday life." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La práctica de transgredir o \"doblar\" los roles de género esperados, lo que a menudo implica adoptar o exagerar rasgos estereotípicamente femeninos o masculinos para exponerlos como artificiales. La transgresión de género es similar al drag, aunque el drag se asocia, a menudo, con representaciones artísticas o escénicas, mientras que la transgresión de género suele representarse en la vida cotidiana." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000047> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000577> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001756> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001816> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderBending> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000563" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender binaries" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Binarios de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cultural conceptions of gender as two distinct and opposing categories, typically man and woman or masculine and feminine." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concepciones culturales del género como dos categorías distintas y opuestas, típicamente hombre y mujer o masculino y femenino." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000220> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000577> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000578> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000590> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001008> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001509> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002589> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderBinary> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000564" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender blending" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mezcla de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gender expression that involves blending dress and behaviors associated with different genders. Do not use to describe the identities of genderqueer or non-binary people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expresión de género que implica mezclar vestimenta y comportamientos asociados a diferentes géneros. No debe utilizarse para describir las identidades de personas queer o no binarias." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderBlending> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000565" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Genderism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Generismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Discriminación de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The systematic belief that there are only two genders (men and women) and that individuals must conform to the gender they were assigned at or shortly after birth." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La creencia sistemática de que solo existen dos géneros (hombres y mujeres) y que las personas deben adaptarse al género que les fue asignado al nacer o poco después." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003158> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001278> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003519> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderism> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000566" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender diversity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Diversidad de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An umbrella term encompassing a range of gender identities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un término general que abarca una variedad de identidades de género." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000358> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001048> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001817> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000358> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderDiversity> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000567" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender dysphoria" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Disforia de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A psychological diagnosis (replacing the outdated and offensive \"gender identity disorder\") used to describe the sense of unease or dissatisfaction an individual feels as a result of incongruence between their gender identity and their assigned gender, gender expression, and/or the way their gender is perceived by others. This term is also used colloquially by individuals to describe the discomfort and distress they experience as a result of this incongruence. Though gender dysphoria is often associated with trans people, people of any identity may experience gender dysphoria when they do not feel \"right\" in their body or the way their gender is being expressed." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un diagnóstico psicológico (que reemplaza al término anticuado y ofensivo de \"trastorno de identidad de género\") utilizado para describir la sensación de malestar o insatisfacción que siente una persona como resultado de la incongruencia entre su identidad de género y su género asignado, su expresión de género y/o la forma en que su género es percibido por otras personas. Este término también se utiliza coloquialmente por personas para describir el malestar y la angustia que experimentan como resultado de esta incongruencia. Aunque la disforia de género a menudo se asocia con las personas trans, las personas de cualquier identidad pueden experimentar disforia de género cuando no se sienten \"bien\" con su cuerpo o con la forma en que se expresan su género." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002699> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002700> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000120> .
