<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
