<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-04-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000568" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender expression" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Expresión de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the way individuals express their gender identity through their appearance and behaviors, including gestures, movement, dress, and grooming." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir la forma en que las personas expresan su identidad de género a través de su apariencia y comportamientos, incluidos gestos, movimientos, vestimenta y arreglo personal." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000047> .
