<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000569" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Genderfluid identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identidad de género fluido" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Genderfluidity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A gender identity in which an individual's gender varies over time and across circumstances; some genderfluid people may identify as a mixture of more than one gender simultaneously." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una identidad de género en la que el género de una persona varía con el tiempo y según las circunstancias; algunas personas de género fluido pueden identificarse como una mezcla de más de un género simultáneamente." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000110> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderfluid> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000570" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Genderfluid people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas de género fluido" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify as different genders at different times, including multiple genders at once or none at all. Only use to describe people who self-identify as genderfluid." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que se identifican con diferentes géneros en diferentes momentos, incluidos varios géneros a la vez o ninguno en absoluto. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como de género fluido." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001817> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000111> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000569> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderfluidPeople> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000571" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identidad de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender-variant identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Identidad de género variable" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person’s experience of having a particular gender, which may or may not correspond with the gender or sex they were assigned at birth. Not to be used to describe solely women’s experiences or women’s studies." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La experiencia de una persona de tener un género particular, que puede o no corresponder al género o sexo asignado al nacer." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
