<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Trastorno de identidad de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An obsolete psychological diagnosis that medicalizes trans identities and practices; only use in historical contexts." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un diagnóstico psicológico obsoleto que medicaliza las identidades y prácticas trans; utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001006> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000567> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85053731> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001004> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderIdentityDisorder> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000573" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender markers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Indicadores de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Markers used to designate an individual's gender on official documentation, including passports, birth certificates, driver’s licenses, etc. Different jurisdictions vary significantly in the number and types of gender markers they allow on official documentation." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marcadores utilizados para designar el género de una persona en la documentación oficial, incluidos pasaportes, certificados de nacimiento, licencias de conducir, etc. Diferentes jurisdicciones varían significativamente en la cantidad y los tipos de marcadores de género que permiten en la documentación oficial." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000377> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001092> .
