<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001465> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003503> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000712> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderMarkers> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000574" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender non-conforming people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas de género no conformistas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas de género no conforme" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify outside, transgress, or do not conform to a given culture's gender roles or expectations. Only use in reference to people who self-identity as gender non-conforming. Do not use to describe cisgender people whose dress or behaviors do not conform to gender roles or expectations." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que se autoidentifican fuera de, transgreden o no se conforman con los roles o expectativas de género de una determinada cultura. Utilícese únicamente en referencia a personas que se autoidentifiquen como no conformes con su género. No se debe utilizar para describir a personas cisgénero cuya vestimenta o comportamiento no se conforma a los roles o expectativas de género." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001817> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001756> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001922> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2017004882> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001817> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderNonConformingPeople> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000575" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relaciones de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The culturally specific rights, responsibilities, and connections afforded to individuals or communities of one gender by individuals or communities of another gender." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Los derechos, responsabilidades y las conexiones culturalmente específicas otorgados a personas o comunidades de un género por personas o comunidades de otro género." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000947> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000499> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000577> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000578> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000778> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002589> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000947> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderRelations> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000576" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender swapping" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intercambio de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender roleplay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Juego de roles de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A media trope (commonly used in fanfiction and fanart) in which one or more characters switch binary sexes (e.g., a cisgender man transforms into a cisgender woman), often temporarily." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un tropo mediático (comúnmente utilizado en fanfiction y fanart) en el que uno o más personajes cambian de sexo binario (por ejemplo, un hombre cisgénero se transforma en una mujer cisgénero), a menudo de forma temporal." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001242> .
