<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002171> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002184> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002210> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderSwapping> .
