<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who self-identify as genderqueer, an umbrella term for queer or non-normative gender identities and gender expressions." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que se autoidentifican como genderqueer, un término general para identidades y expresiones de género queer o no normativas." .
