<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000605" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hair" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pelo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cabello" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Vello" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Threadlike strands of keratin growing out of the skin on the body. Use in reference to hair as a secondary sex characteristic or as a form of self expression." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hilos de queratina que crecen de la piel en el cuerpo. Utilícese en referencia al cabello como característica sexual secundaria o como forma de autoexpresión." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002287> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85058305> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000605> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/hair> .
