<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Halloween gay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000607> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The celebration of Halloween, often called Gay Christmas, by LGBTQ+ people. Typically involves dressing in drag or elaborate costumes as a form of gender play and attending large parties in LGBTQ+ neighborhoods or establishments." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000607> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La celebración de Halloween, a menudo llamada Navidad Gay, por personas LGBTQ+. Por lo general, implica vestirse en drag o disfraces elaborados como forma de jugar con el género y asistir a grandes fiestas en vecindarios o establecimientos LGBTQ+." .
