<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hate crime victims (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Victims of hate crimes (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000613> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000613> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible." .
