<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001323> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000644> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/homonormativity> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000644> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000644> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
