<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002876> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85061980> .
