<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
