<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000654" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hwame" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Native American Mohave tribes, hwame are people assigned female at birth who exhibit masculine traits and are socially male." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En las tribus nativas americanas mohave, los hwame son personas asignadas al sexo femenino al nacer que exhiben rasgos masculinos y son socialmente masculinos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000039> .
