<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000666" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersexphobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersexfobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Interphobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Interfobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed toward intersex people or intersex variations. Intersexphobia can include the denial of the existence of intersex people, insistence that intersex variations should be forcibly \"corrected,\" stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia personas intersex o variaciones intersex. La intersexfobia puede incluir la negación de la existencia de personas intersex, la insistencia en que las variaciones intersex deben \"corregirse\" a la fuerza, estereotipos, acoso verbal y violencia física." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> .
