<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000668> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Children younger than 18 years who describe themselves as intersex." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000668> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Niños menores de 18 años que se autoidentifican como intersex." .
