<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000672> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000672" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersex movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Movimiento intersex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term for activism focused on the rights of intersex people and issues faced by intersex communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000672> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término general para el activismo centrado en los derechos de las personas intersex y los problemas que enfrentan las comunidades intersex." .
