<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000673" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersex rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Derechos intersex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom or entitlement held by intersex people. Often used to refer to intersex people's right to bodily autonomy and, specifically, their right to delay or decline unnecessary medical interventions." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Principios legales, sociales o éticos de libertad o derechos que tienen las personas intersex. A menudo, se utiliza para referirse al derecho de las personas intersex a la autonomía corporal y, específicamente, a su derecho a retrasar o rechazar intervenciones médicas innecesarias." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000652> .
