<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000676> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who are Inuit, or part of several Indigenous peoples inhabiting the Inuit homeland in the Arctic and subarctic regions of Greenland, Canada, and Alaska. Only use for people who identify as Inuit." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000676> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que son inuit o que son parte de varios pueblos indígenas que habitan los territorios ancestrales inuit en las regiones árticas o subárticas de Groenlandia, Canadá y Alaska. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se identifiquen como inuit. " .
