<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001658> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A violation of a couple's assumed or stated contract regarding emotional and/or sexual exclusivity. Should not be used to refer to non-monogamy in general, as cheating is possible in both monogamous and non-monogamous relationships." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001658> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of engaging in romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously without each partner's consent." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001658> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica de entablar relaciones románticas o sexuales con más de una persona simultáneamente sin el consentimiento de cada pareja." .
