<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000684" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jogappa" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In India, this term is used to describe people assigned male at birth who become genderfluid in a spiritual conversion." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En India, este término se utiliza para describir a las personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer y que asumen un género fluido a través de una conversión espiritual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000632> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/jogappa> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000685" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kabuki" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of theatre in Japan that often features crossdressing actors. Historically, female performers played both male and female roles, but women were later banned from performing and were replaced with male performers who played both male and female roles." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un tipo de teatro en Japón donde a menudo figuran actores transformistas. Históricamente, actrices asumían los roles masculinos y femeninos, pero eventualmente se le prohibió a las mujeres presentarse en el escenario y fueron reemplazadas por actores que asumían los roles masculinos y femeninos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001363> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000318> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85071224> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001363> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/kabuki> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000686" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kaposi's sarcoma" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sarcoma de Kaposi" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type of cancer that causes lesions to grow in the skin, lymph nodes, internal organs, and mucous membranes; often affects people with immune deficiencies, such as AIDS." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tipo de cáncer que provoca lesiones en la piel, los ganglios linfáticos, los órganos internos y las mucosas; suele afectar a personas con deficiencias inmunitarias, como el SIDA." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000005> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000033> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001980> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85071562> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/kaposisSarcoma> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000687" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Katoey" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ladyboy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Kathoey" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Thailand, this term refers to a range of people of non-normative gender expressions, including intersex people, transgender women, and effeminate gay men. Some regard this term as outdated and offensive, while others self-identify with it. Only use to describe people who self-identify as katoey." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En Tailandia, este término se refiere a un espectro de personas con expresiones de género no normativas, incluyendo a personas intersex, mujeres transgénero y hombres gay afeminados. Algunas personas consideran este término como anticuado y ofensivo, mientras que otras se autoidentifican con él. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se autoidentifiquen como katoey." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001297> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000340> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/katoey> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000687> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
