<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000688" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khusra" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in Pakistan and Northern India to describe third-gender people, typically people assigned male at birth who identify as female." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado en Pakistán y el norte de la India para describir a personas del tercer género, normalmente personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer y que se autoidentifican como mujeres." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000632> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/khusra> .
