<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000689" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khwaja sira" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khawaja sara" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Khawaja sara" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Khwaja sara" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Khawaja sira" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An umbrella term used in Pakistan and South Asia to describe people assigned male at birth who identify as women, intersex, or third gender." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término del urdu utilizado en el sudeste de Asia para describir a personas transgénero." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
