<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000690> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000690" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kinnar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000690> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A variant term for hijra used in northern India." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000690> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Variante del término \"hijra\" utilizado en el norte de India." .
