<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000691" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kissing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Besar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Besarse" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Touching or pressing one's lips to another person or an object to communicate a greeting, affection, reverence, love, or sexual desire." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tocar o presionar los labios contra otra persona o un objeto para comunicar un saludo, afecto, reverencia, amor o deseo sexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000593> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001112> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001267> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001299> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85072549> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001267> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/kissing> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000692" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Klinefelter syndrome" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Síndrome de Klinefelter" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "47XXY" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People with Klinefelter syndrome develop with an extra copy of the X chromosome, resulting in a 47XXY pattern (instead of the typical 46XY). These individuals might have smaller-than-typical testes that produce lower amounts of testosterone and/or sperm, and they may start puberty later than typical (or may not go through puberty without hormone therapy). They may grow taller than usual, may develop breast tissue, and often experience infertility. This variation often does not cause obvious physical differences, and many people do not realize they have it." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Las personas con síndrome de Klinefelter se desarrollan con una copia adicional del cromosoma X, lo que da como resultado un patrón 47XXY (en lugar del típico 46XY). Estas personas pueden tener testículos más pequeños de lo típico que producen menores cantidades de testosterona y/o esperma, y ​​pueden comenzar la pubertad más tarde de lo normal (o pueden no atravesar la pubertad sin terapia hormonal). Pueden crecer más de lo habitual, desarrollar tejido mamario y, a menudo, experimentar infertilidad. Esta variación a menudo no causa diferencias físicas obvias y muchas personas no se dan cuenta de que la tienen." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000669> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85072641> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/klinefelterSyndrome> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000692> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
