<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000694> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In South Asia, this term is used to describe people who are assigned male at birth who exhibit feminine characteristics. Please note that not all kothis identify as hijra or transgender." .
