<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000699> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term coined by Sigmund Freud to describe erotic attraction towards members of the same sex or gender that is not (and may never be) consciously experienced or expressed openly." .
