<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lesbian Latinos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000747> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Latin American people who are lesbians; only use to describe individuals who self-identify as Latino, Latina, or Latinx. Do not conflate with Chicano/a/x or Hispanic." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000747> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas latinoamericanas que son lesbianas; utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifican como latinos, latinas o latinxs. No debe confundirse con chicano/a/x o hispano/a/x." .
