<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000798" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbian youth literature" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Literatura juvenil lésbica" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on lesbian characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras literarias escritas para una audiencia de lectores de 12 a 18 años de edad, también conocida como literatura para adultos jóvenes o YA (por sus siglas en inglés); utilícese en referencia a la literatura juvenil centrada en personajes o temas lésbicos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001522> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000786> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianYouthLiterature> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000799" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbianism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbianismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sexual orientation of women and femmes who are sexually and/or romantically attracted to other women and femmes. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Orientación sexual de mujeres y femmes que se sienten atraídas sexual y/o románticamente por otras mujeres y femmes. Sin embargo, no todas las lesbianas son mujeres, y las personas disidentes de género que pertenecen a comunidades lésbicas a menudo se han identificado como lesbianas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001298> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000204> .
