<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbians of color" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbianas de color" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbians of colour" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Primarily used in the United States, this term refers to lesbians who are not white and who identify as people of color." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lesbianas que no son blancas y que se autoidentifican como personas de color." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001101> .
