<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000803" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbophobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbofobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed towards lesbianism as an identity or lesbians due to their sexuality, perceived or actual. Lesbophobia can include denial of the existence of lesbianism, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonismo o repugnancia hacia el lesbianismo como identidad o hacia las lesbianas por su sexualidad, percibida o real. La lesbofobia puede incluir la negación de la existencia del lesbianismo, estereotipos, acoso verbal y violencia física." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002591> .
