<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000058> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> .
