<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000928> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who belong to a religion or hold religious beliefs. For LGBTQ+ people who hold spiritual beliefs or engage in spiritual practices but do not belong to an organized religion, use the term \"LGBTQ+ spiritual people.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000928> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que pertenecen a una religión o tienen creencias religiosas. Para las personas LGBTQ+ que tienen creencias espirituales o sostienen prácticas espirituales pero que no pertenecen a una religión organizada, utilícese el término \"personas espirituales LGBTQ+\"." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000815" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ art censorship" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Censura de arte LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ art censorship" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Censura de arte LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Suppression or prohibition of art by LGBTQ+ artists or about LGBTQ+ issues; includes censorship on the basis of religious, moral, political, and/or social objections." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Supresión o prohibición del arte por parte de artistas LGBTQ+ o sobre asuntos LGBTQ+; incluye la censura basada en objeciones religiosas, morales, políticas y/o sociales." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000829> .
