<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000816" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ arts" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Artes LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ arts" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Artes LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term for different forms of creative activity, including visual, material, and performing arts, by LGBTQ+ artists or about LGBTQ+ topics and communities. Use a more specific term if possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término general para diferentes formas de actividad creativa, incluidas las artes visuales, materiales y escénicas, realizadas por artistas LGBTQ+ o sobre temas y comunidades LGBTQ+. Utilícese un término más específico de ser posible." .
