<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000834> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Familias elegidas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000834> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Groups of LGBTQ+ people who have intentionally chosen to nurture, support, and love one another as family, whether or not they have biological or legal relationships." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000834> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grupos de personas LGBTQ+ que han elegido intencionalmente cuidarse, apoyarse y amarse unas a otras como familia, tengan o no relaciones biológicas o legales." .
