<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The active, professed refusal of LGBTQ+ people to obey certain laws or governmental orders as a form of activism and resistance." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La negación activa y declarada de personas LGBTQ+ a obedecer ciertas leyes u órdenes gubernamentales como forma de activismo y resistencia." .
