<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000844> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people exercising their right to refuse to perform military service or participate in same-sex marriages on the grounds of freedom of thought, conscience, and/or religion." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000844> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que ejercen su derecho a negarse a realizar el servicio militar o participar de matrimonios entre personas del mismo sexo por motivos de libertad de pensamiento, conciencia y/o religión." .
