<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000851> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against LGBTQ+ people and advocate for LGBTQ+ visibility, rights, and issues. For street processions of people recognizing and celebrating LGBTQ+ people and culture, use the term \"Pride parades.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000851> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Acción tomada por grandes grupos de personas en protesta por la discriminación o en apoyo a personas, comunidades, temas o derechos LGBTQ+; típicamente incluye marchas y concentraciones con oradores." .
