<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2022-10-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Feelings of close familiarity or connection between two or more LGBTQ+ people that can be romantic, sexual, or platonic in nature. Can be used to describe the particularities of intimacy as experienced by LGBTQ+ people, as well as the ways intimacy is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000889> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sentimientos de estrecha familiaridad o una conexión entre dos o más personas LGBTQ+ que pueden ser de naturaleza romántica, sexual o platónica. Puede utilizarse para describir las particularidades de la intimidad experimentada por las personas LGBTQ+, así como las formas en que se discute y expresa la intimidad dentro de las comunidades LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000859" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ erotic literature" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Literatura erótica LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Erotic literature (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Literatura erótica (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Literary works that have erotic or sexual elements; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on LGBTQ+ characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000859> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras literarias que tengan elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a literatura erótica centrada en personajes o temas LGBTQ+." .
