<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people of shared ethnic or national identities" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ en grupos étnicos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ people in ethnic groups" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ people by ethnicity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ people by nationality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ ethnic people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ethnic LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ethnic people (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term for groups of LGBTQ+ people who share an ethnic or national identity, including a common nationality, country of citizenship, ancestry, culture, language, ethno-religion, etc. Use more specific terms whenever possible. Do not use to describe migrants or immigrants as a whole." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000860> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grupos de personas que comparten una identidad basada en una nacionalidad, cultura, ascendencia, idioma, religión, etc. en común y que también se autoidentifican como LGBTQ+. No debe utilizarse para describir a personas migrantes." .
