<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ film censorship" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Censura de cine LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ film censorship" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The suppression or prohibition of films by LGBTQ+ filmmakers or about LGBTQ+ people and issues; includes censorship due to religious, moral, political, or social objections." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000867> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La supresión o prohibición de películas de cineastas LGBTQ+ o sobre personas y temas LGBTQ+; incluye censura por objeciones religiosas, morales, políticas o sociales." .
