<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000881> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Establishments providing accommodations, meals, and other services for travelers; use in reference to hotels catering to LGBTQ+ people or commonly used by LGBTQ+ people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000881> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Establecimientos que brindan alojamiento, comidas y otros servicios a viajeros; utilícese en referencia a hoteles que atienden a personas LGBTQ+ o que son comúnmente utilizados por personas LGBTQ+." .
