<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Derechos de inmigracion LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ immigration rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Derechos de inmigración LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Derechos migratorios LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal and social entitlement to freedom, equality, and protection held by LGBTQ+ immigrants." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000883> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Derecho legal y social a la libertad, la igualdad y la protección que tienen los inmigrantes LGBTQ+." .
