<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000884" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ incarceration" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Encarcelamiento LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ imprisonment" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Incarceration (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Imprisonment (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Encarcelamiento LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The restraint of an LGBTQ+ person's liberty against their will, with or without legal process, whether by a government authority, institution, or extrajudicial actors. Generally, this refers to physical and/or legal confinement within a jail, prison, detention center, etc. It may also include the forced confinement of LGBTQ+ people within hospitals and other healthcare facilities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Confinamiento, incluida la restricción física y/o legal, de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de una institución o autoridad. Típicamente se utiliza para describir el confinamiento en una prisión pública o privada sentenciado por un tribunal dentro de un sistema penal." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000348> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000348> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQImprisonment> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-04-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000885" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ incest victims" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Víctimas LGBTQ+ de incesto" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ victims of incest" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ incest victims" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who have experienced incest and may or may not have survived; follow individuals' preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que han sufrido el incesto y que pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000959> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002062> .
