<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000887" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ incarcerated people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Prisioneros LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prisoners (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ inmates" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ prisoners" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Incarcerated people (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Incarcerated LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ imprisoned people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Imprisoned people (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Imprisoned LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prisioneros (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people whose liberty is restrained against their will, with or without legal process, whether by a government authority, institution, or extrajudicial actors. Generally, this refers to individuals subject to physical and/or legal confinement within a jail, prison, detention center, etc. It may also include LGBTQ+ people forcibly confined within hospitals and other healthcare facilities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que son privadas de su libertad contra su voluntad por una institución o autoridad. Normalmente se utiliza para describir a personas condenadas a confinamiento en una prisión pública o privada por un tribunal dentro de un sistema penal, pero también puede incluir a personas confinadas por la fuerza en hospitales y otras instituciones." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000924> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000348> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000884> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000887> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPrisoners> .
