<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000891" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ literary awards" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Premios literarios LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ literary awards" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Premios literarios LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Prizes or forms of recognition given in honor of influential LGBTQ+ writers or literary works featuring LGBTQ+ characters and themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Premios o formas de reconocimiento otorgados en honor a escritores o obras literarias LGBTQ+ influyentes que presenten personajes y temas LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000818> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000972> .
