<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000892" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ literary salons" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Salones literarios LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ literary salons" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Salones literarios LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Social gatherings, typically hosted by a notable public figure, for discussing literature or other shared topics; use in reference to literary salons with primarily LGBTQ+ membership or literary salons focused on works featuring LGBTQ+ characters and themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reuniones sociales, normalmente organizadas por una figura pública destacada, para discutir literatura u otros temas compartidos; utilícese en referencia a salones literarios con membresía principalmente LGBTQ+ o salones literarios centrados en obras con personajes y temas LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000909> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000972> .
