<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000893" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ lobbying" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cabildeo LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ lobbying" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cabildeo LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lobbying LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lobbying LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Actions taken by individuals or groups to influence legislative action (or non-action), policies, or decisions of government officials in favor of LGBTQ+ people, communities, or issues." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Acciones tomadas por personas o grupos para influir en la acción (o inacción) legislativa, las políticas o las decisiones de funcionarios gubernamentales, a favor de personas, comunidades o asuntos LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000853> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702> .
