<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000895" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ lovers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Amantes LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lovers (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ lovers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Amantes LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Amantes (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people engaging in sexual or romantic relationships with other people; typically used to describe people who are not married." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000895> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que mantienen relaciones sexuales o románticas con otras personas; normalmente se utiliza para describir a personas que no están casadas." .
