<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000919" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ petitions" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Peticiones LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ petitions" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Peticiones LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written requests for political or social action that are addressed to government officials or public entities and signed by numerous people; use in reference to petitions created by or addressing LGBTQ+ organizations, communities, and/or concerns." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Solicitudes escritas para acción política o social dirigidas a funcionarios gubernamentales o entidades públicas, y firmadas por numerosas personas; utilícese en referencia a peticiones creadas o dirigidas a organizaciones, comunidades y/o inquietudes LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000853> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000006> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPetitions> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000920" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ phobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Fobia LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ phobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fobia LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed towards LGBTQ+ identities or people due to their sexuality or gender, perceived or actual. LGBTQ+ phobia can include denial of the existence of certain LGBTQ+ identities, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia identidades o personas LGBTQ+ debido a su sexualidad o género, percibido o real. La fobia LGBTQ+ puede incluir la negación de la existencia de ciertas identidades LGBTQ+, estereotipos, acoso verbal y violencia física." .
