<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Refugees (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ refugees" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Refugiados LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Refugiados (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who have fled to another country to escape war, persecution, natural disaster, or other forms of conflict. Only use for people legally recognized as refugees; otherwise, use LGBTQ+ asylum seekers." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000927> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que han huido a otro país para escapar de la guerra, la persecución, los desastres naturales u otras formas de conflicto. Utilícese únicamente para personas legalmente reconocidas como refugiadas; en caso contrario, utilícese \"solicitantes de asilo LGBTQ+\"." .
