<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Resorts (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000929> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Commercial establishments providing lodging, entertainment, food, drinks, sporting, and shopping; use in reference to resorts that cater primarily to LGBTQ+ people or are known to be frequented by LGBTQ+ people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000929> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Establecimientos comerciales que brindan alojamiento, entretenimiento, alimentos, bebidas, deportes y lugares de compras; utilícese en referencia a resorts que principalmente atienden a personas LGBTQ+ o que son conocidos por ser frecuentados por personas LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000881> .
