<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ restaurants" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Restaurantes LGBTQ+" .
