<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Restaurants (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000930> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Commercial establishments that prepare and serve food and drinks; use in reference to restaurants that cater primarily to LGBTQ+ people or are known to be frequented by LGBTQ+ people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000930> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Establecimientos comerciales que preparan y sirven alimentos y bebidas; utilícese en referencia a restaurantes que atienden principalmente a personas LGBTQ+ o que son conocidos por ser frecuentados por personas LGBTQ+." .
