<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000931> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Multi-residence facilities that provide assisted living services to elderly people; use in reference to retirement homes that primarily cater to LGBTQ+ people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000931> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instalaciones multiresidencia que brindan servicios de vida asistida a personas mayores; utilícese en referencia a casas de retiro que atienden principalmente a personas LGBTQ+." .
