<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lubricantes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000977> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Liquids or gels used during sexual activity, typically to ease the act of penetration by a penis or a sex toy." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000977> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Líquidos o geles utilizados durante la actividad sexual, generalmente para facilitar el acto de penetración de un pene o un juguete sexual." .
