<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Marital status" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Estado civil" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000989> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person's state of being single, married, separated, divorced, or widowed, as defined by a government or legal authority." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000989> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El estado de una persona de estar soltera, casada, separada, divorciada o viuda, según lo define un gobierno o una autoridad legal." .
