<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mashoga" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000996> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Swahili term for people assigned male at birth who engage in sex with men and who may dress as women." .
