<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000997> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Erotic or sexual enjoyment of pain and intense sensations. " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000997> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Disfrute erótico o sexual del dolor y de sensaciones intensas." .
