<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Organized measures taken for the maintenance or improvement of health via the prevention, diagnosis, treatment, or cure of disease, illness, injury, or other condition." .
