<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001254> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001297> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/menWhoHaveSexWithMen> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
