<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Desórdenes mentales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Mental illnesses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Psychiatric disorders" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Enfermedades mentales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Desórdenes psiquiátricos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trastornos mentales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Medical conditions defined by changes or disturbances in an individual's thinking, feeling, mood, and behavior." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Condiciones médicas definidas por cambios o alteraciones en el pensamiento, los sentimientos, el estado de ánimo y el comportamiento de una persona." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000392> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85083643> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/mentalDisorders> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-02-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001011> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
