<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000952> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001366> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003990> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000614> .
