<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001038> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001038> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/nudism> .
