<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001926> .
