<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Paternity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The experience of acting as a father, including the responsibilities involved in fathering and raising children." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La experiencia de actuar como padre, incluidas las responsabilidades que implica la paternidad y la crianza de los hijos." .
