<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> " Telephone sex operators" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Operadores de sexo por teléfono" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001111> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who perform real-time sex work via phone calls, text messaging, or online voice calls. Use \"Cam models\" for individuals who perform real-time sex work via streaming video or video calls." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001111> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
