<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001114" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Piercings" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Perforación" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Perforaciones" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Small holes or openings made in parts of the body to insert jewelry or implants, whether for aesthetic purposes, spiritual or religious reasons, or sexual pleasure." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pequeños agujeros o aperturas realizadas en partes del cuerpo para insertar joyas o implantes, ya sea con fines estéticos, espirituales o religiosos, o por placer sexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000214> .
