<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001115" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pinching (Erotic)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pellizcar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Form of manual stimulation involving gripping, pulling, or putting tension on parts of one’s body or another person's body for sexual stimulation, arousal, or pleasure." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Forma de estimulación manual que implica agarrar, jalar, o poner tensión en partes del cuerpo de una misma persona o de otra persona para estimulación, excitación o placer sexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/pinching> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-03-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
