<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001119" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cops" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A civil force empowered by the state to enforce the law and maintain public order." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fuerza civil facultada por el Estado para hacer cumplir la ley y mantener el orden público." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002397> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85104183> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/police> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-02-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001120" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police entrapment" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aprisionamiento policial" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Agentes encubiertos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A practice in which law enforcement agents or agents of the state coerce an individual to commit a \"crime\" they would have otherwise been unlikely or unwilling to commit. Legal definitions of entrapment vary widely depending on the jurisdiction, but the term is often used colloquially to refer to police acting dishonestly or in bad faith, as well as policing focused on anticipating and inducing crime, rather than responding to reports of crime." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica en la que los agentes de las fuerzas de seguridad o los agentes del Estado fuerzan a una persona a cometer un \"delito\" que, de otro modo, probablemente no cometería o no estaría dispuesta a cometer. Las definiciones jurídicas de la trampa varían mucho en función de la jurisdicción, pero el término se utiliza a menudo coloquialmente para referirse a la policía que actúa de forma deshonesta o de mala fe, así como a la actuación policial centrada en anticipar e inducir el delito, en lugar de responder a las denuncias de delitos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000068> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044146> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeEntrapment> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001121" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police harassment" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acoso policial" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Harrassment by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Misconduct by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Mistreatment by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police misconduct" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police mistreatment" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder cometidos por agentes de las fuerzas de seguridad o agentes del Estado contra miembros del público. Esto incluye, entre otros, la elaboración de perfiles raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo; la vigilancia, el registro y la incautación injustificados; la aplicación selectiva de la ley; el uso excesivo de la fuerza; la conducta sexual indebida; la intimidación y la manipulación de testigos; la falsificación de pruebas; las confesiones forzadas; las detenciones y encarcelamientos falsos; y el soborno o el cabildeo." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95010616> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeHarassment> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001122" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dawn raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No-knock raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of residences or establishments by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Entradas y registros inesperados y sin previo aviso en residencias o establecimientos por parte de agentes de las fuerzas policiales con el objetivo de utilizar la sorpresa para incautar pruebas o detener a sospechosos. Las redadas policiales pueden realizarse legalmente mediante una orden de registro o por circunstancias apremiantes, como la causa probable, aunque esta última es muy subjetiva y los civiles suelen tener pocos recursos para apelar a las redadas ilegales." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeRaids> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001123" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polyamory" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Poliamor" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of engaging in romantic, sexual, or play relationships with more than one person simultaneously, with the knowledge and consent of all parties involved." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica de entablar relaciones románticas, sexuales o de juego con más de una persona simultáneamente, con el conocimiento y consentimiento de todas las partes involucradas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001554> .
