<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001234" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reciprocal in vitro fertilization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Fertilización in vitro recíproca" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reciprocal in vitro fertilisation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Shared motherhood" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Maternidad compartida" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical procedure in which the egg of one partner is fertilized with donor sperm and then transferred to the uterus of the other partner to bring to term." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un procedimiento médico en el que el óvulo de una pareja se fertiliza con esperma de un donante y luego se transfiere al útero de la otra pareja para llevarlo a término." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000659> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000864> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001234> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/reciprocalInVitroFertilisation> .
