<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001255" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Same-sex divorce" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Divorcio entre personas del mismo sexo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A legal proceeding undertaken to dissolve a marriage between two individuals of the same sex." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Procedimiento legal emprendido para disolver un matrimonio entre dos personas del mismo sexo." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000854> .
