<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001258" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sea queens" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Reinas del mar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used before the 1960s to describe gay men who worked aboard ships, mainly merchant vessels." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado antes de la década de 1960 para describir a los hombres gay que trabajaban a bordo de barcos, principalmente buques mercantes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000878> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000506> .
