<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001259" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Secondary sex characteristics" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Características sexuales secundarias" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Features that appear during puberty that are not directly related to reproduction, like changes in the voice and the development of body hair." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Características que aparecen durante la pubertad que no están directamente relacionadas con la reproducción, como cambios en la voz y el desarrollo del vello corporal." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000222> .
