<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001260" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Second-wave feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminismo de segunda ola" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Second wave feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Period of feminist political activity (also referred to as women’s liberation) beginning in the early 1960s that critiqued male-dominated institutions and cultural practices in society." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Período de actividad política feminista (también conocido como liberación de la mujer) que comenzó a principios de la década de 1960 y que criticó las instituciones y prácticas culturales dominadas por los hombres en la sociedad." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003158> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003173> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008001560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001260> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/secondWaveFeminism> .
