<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001264> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Madagascar, this term refers to people of a third gender who were assigned male at birth and present feminine characteristics." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001264> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En Madagascar, este término se refiere a las personas de un tercer género a las que se les asignó al sexo masculino al nacer y presentan características femeninas." .
