<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trabajo sexual LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001277> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe LGBTQ+ people working across the broad spectrum of sex work." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001277> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que reciben dinero o bienes a cambio de servicios o actuaciones sexuales. Utilícese para describir a las personas LGBTQ+ que trabajan en el amplio espectro del trabajo sexual." .
