<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sexual harassment" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acoso sexual" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unwelcome behavior of a sexual nature, including unwanted advances or requests for sexual favors." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Comportamiento no deseado de naturaleza sexual, incluidos insinuaciones no deseadas o pedidos de favores sexuales." .
