<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tida wena" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001372> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Venezuela's indigenous Warao culture, this term refers to people assigned male at birth who are thought to possess two spirits and often assume a spiritual role; translates to \"twisted women.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001372> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En la cultura indígena warao de Venezuela, este término se refiere a las personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer y que se cree que poseen dos espíritus y que, a menudo, asumen un papel espiritual; se traduce como \"mujeres retorcidas\"." .
