<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Marchas transgénero" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against trans people and advocate for trans visibility, rights, and issues." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Marchas y encuentros centrados en cuestiones y derechos trans." .
