<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transfeminine people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas transfemeninas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001382> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify partially or fully with a feminine gender identity and who were typically (but not always) assigned male at birth." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001382> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que se identifican parcial o totalmente con una identidad de género femenina y a quienes normalmente (pero no siempre) se les asignó al sexo masculino al nacer." .
