<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "African American transgender people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas transgénero afroamericanas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Transgender African American people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Transgender African Americans" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afroamericanos transgénero" .
