<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001406> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cultural experiences shared by members of transgender communities or products of transgender culture (e.g., art and media created by and for transgender people, activism focused on transgender issues, slang commonly used in transgender communities, etc.)." .
