<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001460> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transgender people’s legal rights to be informed, present, and heard within the criminal justice system after having been harmed or injured as the result of of a crime, accident, or other event." .
