<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transmasculine people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas transmasculinas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001466> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Trans people assigned female at birth who identify partially or fully with a masculine gender." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001466> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas trans asignadas al sexo femenino al nacer que se autoidentifican parcial o totalmente con un género masculino." .
