<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transsexualism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transexualismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001468> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual's identification with a gender inconsistent with or not culturally associated with their assigned sex." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001468> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La identificación de una persona con un género inconsistente o no asociado culturalmente con su sexo asignado." .
