<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Twinkies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Twinks" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Yogurín" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001479> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "U.S. slang term for young gay men who are typically small in stature, hairless, and considered effeminate." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001479> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término de la jerga estadounidense para referirse a hombres gay jóvenes que suelen ser de baja estatura, lampiños y considerados afeminados." .
