<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001517> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Arabic word used in Oman for people who assigned male at birth who adopt feminine mannerisms and/or roles." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001517> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Palabra árabe utilizada en Omán para las personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer y que adoptan gestos y/o roles femeninos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322> .
