<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A twelve step program based in the U.S. that treats alcoholism as a disease and aims to address its impact on the adult lives of children of alcoholics; may be used in reference to LGBTQ+ members of ACA or LGBTQ+-focused chapters of ACA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An international organization aimed toward supporting alcoholics in sobriety through a twelve-step program; may be used in reference to LGBTQ+ individuals in AA or LGBTQ+ chapters of AA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recovery groups, or voluntary associations of people in recovery from use disorders, conditions, or addictions, that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grupos de recuperación, o asociaciones voluntarias de personas en recuperación de trastornos por consumo, condiciones o adicciones, que aceptan y apoyan a las personas LGBTQ+ y sus identidades." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001012> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001528" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001530" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001540" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alcoholics " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alcoholism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people with alcohol use disorders" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ con trastornos por consumo de alcohol" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who are addicted to alcohol or have alcohol dependencies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who have been diagnosed with or regard themselves as having an alcohol use disorder, a medical condition that involves a pattern of alcohol use that is difficult to control, negatively impacts the individual's life, and results in withdrawal symptoms upon cessation. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having an alcohol use disorder. Follow the individual's preference for \"use disorder\" or \"addiction\" whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que han sido diagnosticadas o que reconocen que tienen un trastorno por consumo de alcohol, una condición médica que implica un patrón de consumo de alcohol difícil de controlar, que afecta negativamente la vida de la persona y que provoca síntomas de abstinencia al dejar de consumirlo. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como padeciendo de un trastorno por consumo de alcohol. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"trastorno por consumo\" o \"adicción\" siempre que sea posible." .
