<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001531" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Allosexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alosexualidad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sexual orientation generally characterized by the occurrence of sexual attraction or the desire for partnered sexual experiences." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una orientación sexual generalmente caracterizada por la atracción sexual o el deseo de tener experiencias sexuales en pareja." .
