<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bares leather" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bars or clubs that cater to or which are known to be especially friendly to the leather community." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bares o clubes que atienden a miembros de la comunidad de cuero." .
