<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001559> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/reclaimedTerms> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001559> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2020-06-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
