<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001561> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Widespread disapproval of a group of people or set of behaviors based on preconceived ideas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001561> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Desaprobación generalizada de un grupo de personas o de un conjunto de conductas basada en ideas preconcebidas." .
