<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002228" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sobriety" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people practicing sobriety" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ que practican la sobriedad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conscious abstinence from addictive or mind-altering substances, typically alcohol or drugs." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people intentionally refraining from substance use (typically drugs or alcohol). Follow the individual's preference for \"sobriety\" or \"recovery\" whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que se abstienen intencionalmente de consumir sustancias (usualmente drogas o alcohol). Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"sobriedad\" o  \"recuperación\" siempre que sea posible." .
