<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ literary criticism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crítica literaria LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Literary criticism (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Crítica literaria LGBTQ" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001602> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The study, evaluation, and interpretation of literary works focusing on LGBTQ+ characters or themes; can also include interpretation of literature through the lens and frameworks associated with LGBTQ+ studies." .
