<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001627> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who experience infrequent, rare, or low-intensity sexual attraction." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001627> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que experimentan una atracción sexual infrecuente, rara o de baja intensidad." .
