<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001629" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hierarchical non-monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "No monogamia jerárquica" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hierarchical polyamory" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hierarchical nonmonogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Poliamor jerárquico" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of consensual non-monogamy in which a person has multiple partners who are not \"equal\" to one another in terms of time, emotional intensity, financial, or scheduling matters." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de no monogamia consensuada en la que una persona tiene múltiples parejas que no son \"iguales\" entre sí en términos de tiempo, intensidad emocional, cuestiones financieras o de calendarización." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> .
