<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001630" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Large breasts" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Senos grandes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gigantomastia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Macromastia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Breast hypertrophy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Breasts considered large within a given cultural context. Note that large breasts have various health issues associated with them and may carry stigmatized medical associations (such as terms like gigantomastia and macromastia). These terms have more specific medical meanings but should not be used outside of those specific contexts." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Senos considerados grandes dentro de un contexto cultural determinado. Tenga en cuenta que los senos grandes implican varios problemas de salud asociados y pueden conllevar asociaciones médicas estigmatizadas (tales como términos como gigantomastia y macromastia). Estos términos tienen significados médicos más específicos, pero no deben utilizarse fuera de esos contextos específicos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001623> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000222> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001623> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/largeBreasts> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2020-12-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001631" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mastectomy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mastectomía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Breast amputation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Amputación de senos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A surgical procedure aimed at removing the breast or as much breast tissue as possible; often undergone as part of \"top surgery\" for transgender men or nonbinary people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un procedimiento quirúrgico destinado a extirpar la mama o la mayor cantidad de tejido mamario posible; a menudo se realiza como parte de una \"cirugía superior\" para hombres transgénero o personas no binarias." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001840> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000222> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001622> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001841> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85081984> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001004> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/mastectomy> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2020-12-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001632> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001632" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Megasexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Megasexualidad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001632> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sexual orientation generally characterized by a person's lack of emotional connection to other people unless or until they have formed a strong sexual connection with them first." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001632> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una orientación sexual generalmente caracterizada por la falta de conexión emocional de una persona con otras personas a menos que, o hasta que, primero esa persona haya formado una fuerte conexión sexual con ellas." .
