<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "X assigned at birth" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "XAAB" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Asignadx X al nacer" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "AXAN" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assignment of an \"X\" gender marker or \"X\" sex designation shortly after birth. It is uncommon for intersex people to be assigned intersex or X at birth.\r\n" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La asignación de un marcador de género \"X\" o una designación de sexo \"X\" poco después del nacimiento. Es poco común que a las personas intersexuales se les asigne intersex o X al nacer." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001268> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000669> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002884> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/assignedXAtBirth> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001648" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Assigned sex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sexo asignado" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual's sex as determined by a medical practitioner or provider. Determination is usually based on the appearance of external genitalia but may use other methodologies. In practice, sex assigned at birth is often culturally variable; the term \"assigned gender\" is often more applicable or accurate.\r\n" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El sexo de una persona determinado por un médico. La determinación suele basarse en la apariencia de los genitales externos, pero pueden utilizarse otras metodologías. En la práctica, el sexo asignado al nacer suele variar culturalmente; el término \"género asignado\" suele ser más aplicable o preciso." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001268> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000078> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000266> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001896> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001897> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001269> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/assignedSex> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001649" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compersion" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compersión" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The positive emotion an individual may experience in regards to their partner's relationship with another partner. Often defined as the opposite of jealousy." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La emoción positiva que una persona puede experimentar con respecto a la relación de su pareja con otra pareja. A menudo se define como lo opuesto a los celos." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/compersion> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001650" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compulsory monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Monogamia obligatoria" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assumption that all people share a desire for monogamous relationships and that this is a preferential life goal." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La suposición de que todas las personas comparten el deseo de tener relaciones monógamas y que este es un objetivo preferencial en la vida." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001532> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001535> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001636> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001916> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/compulsoryMonogamy> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001651" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Consensual non-monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "No monogamia consensual" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ethical Non-monogamy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No monogamia ética" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "NMC" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "NME" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously and with all the consent of all partners involved." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica de relaciones románticas o sexuales con más de una persona simultáneamente y con el consentimiento de todas las parejas involucradas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001659> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> .
