<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001655" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Honeymooning" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Luna de miel" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A period of time in a relationship characterized by passionate love as well as intense feelings of attraction and ecstasy, sometimes accompanied by idealization of a partner or the shared relationship." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un periodo de tiempo en una relación caracterizado por un amor apasionado al igual que por intensos sentimientos de atracción y éxtasis, a veces acompañados por la idealización de la pareja o de la relación compartida." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001661> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/honeymooning> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001655> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
