<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001656" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Monogamish" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Relaciones casi monógamas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe relationships that are mostly monogamous with occasional exceptions made for sexual play." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir relaciones que son, en su mayoría, monógamas con excepciones ocasionales para el juego sexual." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001641> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001916> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001636> .
