<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001664" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polyfidelity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polifidelidad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Poliexclusividad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In polyamory circles, this term refers to the practice of engaging in multiple-partner relationships that are \"closed off\" to new participants per the agreement of those involved." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "En los círculos de poliamor, este término se refiere a la práctica de entablar relaciones con múltiples parejas que están \"cerradas\" a nuevos participantes según el acuerdo de las partes involucradas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001123> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001629> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/polyfidelity> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
