<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001665" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Relationship anarchists" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anarquistas relacionales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anarquistas de relación" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who practice a type of non-monogamy characterized by application of anarchist principles (such as autonomy, anti-normativity, anti-hierarchical practices, refusal of state governance) to relationships. Often contrasted with hierarchical polyamory." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que practican un tipo de no monogamia caracterizada por la aplicación de principios anarquistas (como la autonomía, la antinormatividad, las prácticas antijerárquicas, el rechazo de la gobernanza estatal) a las relaciones. A menudo, se contrasta con el poliamor jerárquico." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001637> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001651> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001660> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001666> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001637> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001665> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/relationshipAnarchists> .
