<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Frotar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Scissoring" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Golpearse las almejas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hacer la tijera" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Typically, a sexual activity in which two women rub their genitalia against one \r\nanother while intertwining their legs." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001667> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una actividad sexual en la que, normalmente, dos mujeres frotan sus genitales una contra la otra mientras entrelazan sus piernas." .
