<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001668> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgenderqueer people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001668> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas transgenderqueer" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001668> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Someone who is both trans and genderqueer and who identifies as transgenderqueer.\r\n" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001668> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Alguien que es transgénero y genderqueer y que se identifica como transgénero queer.\n" .
