<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hacer la tortilla" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Untar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Raspar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Rastillar" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Restregarse" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mostly antiquated term used either to refer to scissoring, to any sexual activity between women, or to the general concept of being a lesbian (\"lesbianism\")." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un término mayoritariamente anticuado utilizado para referirse a hacer tijeras, a cualquier actividad sexual entre mujeres o al concepto general de ser lesbiana (\"lesbianismo\")." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000878> .
