<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001670" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Xenogender identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identidad xenogénero" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Non-binary gender identity that is not defined in relation to human understandings of gender (i.e., female or male, woman or man), but instead in relation to animals, plants, or other things" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identidad de género no binaria que no se define en relación a la interpretación humana del género (es decir, femenino o masculino, mujer u hombre), sino en relación a animales, plantas u otras cosas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001048> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/xenogender> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-06-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001671" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Xenogender people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas xenogénero" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person who identifies their gender in relation to non-human understandings of gender and relates to animals, plants, or other things." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una persona que identifica su género en relación a interpretaciones no humanas del género y se relaciona a animales, plantas u otras cosas." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001048> .
