<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001778> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Two-Spirit people who are trained, professional cooks, typically holding a leadership role in the kitchen in which they are employed." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001778> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas dos espíritus que son cocineras profesionales capacitadas y que normalmente desempeñan un papel de liderazgo en la cocina en la que trabajan." .
