<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Vers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Versatile" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Versátil" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Slang term for individuals who alternate between being the giving partner and the receiving partner in sexual encounters; typically used as an adjective (e.g., \"They're vers.\")." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001779> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término de la jerga para personas que alternan entre ser la pareja que da y la que recibe en encuentros sexuales; normalmente se utiliza como adjetivo (por ejemplo, \"Ella es vers\")." .
