<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trans4Trans" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "tft" .
