<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001782> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Black queer people who recognize their queer identity as salient to their Blackness and vice versa; only use to describe individuals who identify as Blaqueer or BlaQ." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001782> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas negras queer que reconocen su identidad queer como imprescindible para su negritud y viceversa; utilícese para describir a personas que se autoidentifican como Blaqueer o BlaQ." .
