<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001790" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Packers (Phallus)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Packers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prótesis de pene" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Padding or phallic objects designed to be worn in the front of an individual's pants or underwear to give the appearance of having a bulge." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Objetos acolchados o fálicos diseñados para usarse en la parte delantera de los pantalones o la ropa interior de una persona para dar la apariencia de tener un protuberancia." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000568> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001067> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001099> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021-12-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001791> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001791" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alloromanticism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Alorromanticismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001791> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A romantic orientation characterized by the occurrence of romantic attraction or desire in a frequent and consistent manner, often alongside sexual attraction." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001791> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una orientación romántica caracterizada por la atracción o el deseo romántico de manera frecuente y constante, a menudo junto con la atracción sexual." .
