<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001810> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe the identity of people who are both Indigenous and queer and view those identities as inherently related and interconnected." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001810> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir la identidad de personas que son tanto indígenas como queer y ven esas identidades como inherentemente relacionadas e interconectadas." .
