<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transfemininity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transfeminidad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001821> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Feminine-aligned identities or practices of trans people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001821> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identidades o prácticas alineadas con lo femenino de personas trans." .
