<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas panrománticas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001827> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who experience romantic attraction or romantic desire toward others in a frequent and consistent manner irrespective of sex or gender." .
