<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001832> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cultural experiences shared by members of queer communities or products of queer culture (e.g., art and media created by and for queer people, activism focused on queer issues, slang commonly used in queer communities, etc.)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001832> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Experiencias culturales compartidas por miembros de comunidades queer o productos de la cultura queer (por ejemplo, arte y medios creados por y para personas queer, activismo centrado en cuestiones queer, jerga comúnmente utilizada en comunidades queer, etc.)." .
