<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001849> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-02-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001849> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
