<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001903> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transmisoginoir" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term coined by coined by Trudy of the womanist blog Gradient Lair to describe the intersection of transphobia, misogyny, and anti-Black racism as directed toward Black trans women." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término acuñado por Trudy del blog mujerista Gradient Lair para describir la intersección de la transfobia, la misoginia y el racismo anti-negro dirigido hacia las mujeres trans negras." .
