<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas polisexuales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Polysexuals" .
