<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas intersex hispanas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Intersex people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas intersexuales que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x." .
