<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002272> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003691> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003692> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85110266> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002039" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminist theory" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Teoría feminista" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Feminist philosophy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Theory of feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Filosofía feminista" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Teoría del feminismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The extension of feminism into theoretical, fictional, or philosophical discourse, often seeking to understand the nature of gender inequity." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La extensión del feminismo al discurso teórico, ficticio o filosófico, que a menudo trata de comprender la naturaleza de la desigualdad de género." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001365> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003444> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003706> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000579> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001210> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90002282> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001365> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002040" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Female gaze" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mirada femenina" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used to describe the depiction of women in media and the arts as subjects with agency and whose perspective a text may be presented from. Often used in contrast to the male gaze." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir la representación de las mujeres en los medios y las artes como sujetos con agencia y desde cuya perspectiva se puede presentar un texto. A menudo, se utiliza en contraste a la mirada masculina." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001365> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002041" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Male gaze" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mirada masculina" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used to describe the sexualized and objectified depiction of women in media and the arts from the perspective of and for the pleasure of the heterosexual man/male viewer. Originally used solely to describe the heterosexual, cisgender gaze but has since been expanded." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir la representación sexualizada y cosificada de las mujeres en los medios y las artes desde la perspectiva y para el placer hombre heterosexual/espectador masculino. Originalmente se utilizaba únicamente para describir la mirada heterosexual y cisgénero, pero desde entonces se ha ampliado." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002039> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001365> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002042" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queer gaze" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mirada queer" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used to describe the ways LGBTQ+ people create and engage with media and art, in contrast to the male gaze, female gaze, or straight gaze." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un término utilizado para describir las formas en que las personas LGBTQ+ crean e interactúan con los medios y el arte, en contraste a la mirada masculina, la mirada femenina o la mirada hetero." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001219> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001149> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002040> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002041> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001365> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002043" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminine of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "FOC" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fem of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Femme of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe individuals whose gender expression is more feminine than androgynous. Generally used as a self-descriptor within LGBTQ+ communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000389> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000440> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001382> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001642> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001652> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002061> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002043> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
