<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ South Asian people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ South Asians" .
