<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bandslash" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Band slash" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002147> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fanfiction that focuses on, incorporates, or details the romantic or sexual relationships between same-gender or same-sex musicians who exist in the real world, usually men." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002147> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fanfiction que se centra, incorpora o detalla las relaciones románticas o sexuales entre músicos del mismo género o del mismo sexo que existen en el mundo real, normalmente hombres." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002196> .
