<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "BL" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Boys Love" .
