<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fan works" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fanworks" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002161> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Works, such as fanfiction or fanart, created by fans using characters, settings, and/or plots of other media properties." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002161> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras, como fanfiction o fanart, creadas por fanáticos utilizando personajes, escenarios y/o tramas de otras propiedades mediáticas." .
