<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Fursuits" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Traje de furro" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Traje de furry" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fursuit" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Costumes worn by furries that represent their fursonas (i.e., anthropomorphized animal versions of themselves)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002169> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Disfraces utilizados por furros que representan sus fursonas (es decir, versiones animales antropomorfizadas de ellos mismos)" .
