<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002191> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002192> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002192> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-07-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002192> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
