<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slash manips" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002206> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fan-created photo manipulations or deepfakes depicting sexual or romantic relationships between characters from various media properties. Typically erotic or pornographic in nature. Historically used for male-male couples only, but is now used more broadly; includes femslash manips." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002204> .
