<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slash vidding" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002209> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Creating videos about sexual or romantic relationships between same-sex or -gender couples using scenes from television, movies, or video games. Historically used for male-male couples only, but is now used more broadly; includes femslash vidding." .
