<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who use substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) in order to manage pain and other symptoms related to a medical condition or disability." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias (que suelen ser consideradas nocivas o están sujetas a restricciones legales, como las drogas o el alcohol) para controlar el dolor y otros síntomas relacionados con una enfermedad o discapacidad." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000380> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001854> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001879> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0004226> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
