<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000571> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002699> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002700> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003193> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003708> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002256> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-09-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
