<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002269" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anti-racism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anti-racismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Antiracism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Antirracismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term used to describe a range of ideas, policies, and political actions that are intended to actively challenge, reject, or oppose racism and racial oppression (whether personal or systemic), as well as advocate for racial equity." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término general utilizado para describir una variedad de ideas, políticas y acciones políticas que tienen como objetivo desafiar, rechazar u oponerse activamente al racismo y la opresión racial (ya sea personal o sistémica), así como defender la equidad racial." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001902> .
