<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002270" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Black feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminismo negro" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro-feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro feminismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro-feminismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of feminism that developed in response to the failures of mainstream feminist and civil rights efforts to acknowledge the ways white supremacy and the patriarchy interact to inform the particular experiences of Black women." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de feminismo que se desarrolló en respuesta a los fracasos de los esfuerzos feministas y de derechos civiles dominantes para reconocer las formas en que la supremacía blanca y el patriarcado interactúan para informar las experiencias particulares de las mujeres negras." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000667> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002272> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003170> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-11-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002271" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminismo blanco" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe (and criticize) forms of feminism that focus on the needs of white women at the expense of women of color." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir (y criticar) formas de feminismo que se centran en las necesidades de las mujeres blancas a expensas de las mujeres de color." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000667> .
