<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002327> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term that encompasses LGBTQ+ filmmaking, the LGBTQ+ film industry, and film as an art form within LGBTQ+ culture. For specific movies created by or representing LGBTQ+ people, use the term \"LGBTQ+ films.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002327> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término que abarca el cine LGBTQ+, la industria cinematográfica LGBTQ+ y el cine como forma de arte dentro de la cultura LGBTQ+. Para películas específicas creadas por personas LGBTQ+ o que las representen, utilice el término \"películas LGBTQ+\"." .
