<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002332" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Two-Spirit history" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Historia dos espíritus" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "2S history" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Two Spirit history" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Two Spirited history" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Two-Spirited history" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Past events or accounts of the past concerning Two-Spirit people, or people who might be perceived as Two-Spirit if they were alive today." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Eventos pasados o relatos del pasado relacionados con personas dos espíritus o con personas que podrían ser percibidas como dos espíritus si estuvieran vivas hoy." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002260> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002260> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-11-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002333" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people of the African diaspora" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ de la diáspora africana" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people of native African ancestry living outside of the continent of Africa. While this term is commonly used to describe descendants of Africans who were enslaved and forcibly transported to the Americas via the transatlantic slave trade between the 16th and 19th centuries, it can also be used to refer to descendants of Africans who voluntarily immigrated to other parts of the world. Do not conflate with Black LGBTQ+ people or African American LGBTQ+ people. Follow the individual's preference whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ de ascendencia africana nativa que viven fuera del continente africano. Si bien este término se utiliza comúnmente para describir a quienes descienden de personas africanas que fueron esclavizadas y forzosamente transportadas a América a través de la trata transatlántica de esclavos entre los siglos XVI y XIX, también se puede utilizar para referirse quienes descienden de personas africanas que emigraron voluntariamente a otras partes del mundo. No lo combine ni confunda con personas negras LGBTQ+ o personas afroamericanas LGBTQ+. Siga las preferencias de la persona siempre que sea posible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2022-11-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-04-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002334" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Black asexual people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas asexuales negras" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Asexual Black people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Black ace people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas negras asexuales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas negras ace" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Black people who are asexual. Use only for individuals who self-identity as Black. Follow the individual’s preference for African American or Black whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas negras que son asexuales. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como negras. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"afroamericanos\" o \"negros\" siempre que sea posible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000208> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002893> .
