<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002898> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915> .
