<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002342> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who act as a father to one or more LGBTQ+ person. For fathers who are themselves LGBTQ+, use the term \"LGBTQ+ fathers.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002342> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas LGBTQ+. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres." .
