<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police interactions with LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Interacciones policiales con personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police treatment of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Policing and the LGBTQ+ community" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Tratamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Vigilancia y la comunidad LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Umbrella term including any of various forms of interactions between police and LGBTQ+ individuals or communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término general que incluye cualquiera de las diversas formas de interacción entre la policía y personas o comunidades LGBTQ+." .
