<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001326> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001349> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
