<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002374" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police entrapment of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aprisionamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Atrapamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A practice in which law enforcement agents or agents of the state coerce an LGBTQ+ person to commit a \"crime\" they would have otherwise been unlikely or unwilling to commit. Legal definitions of entrapment vary widely depending on the jurisdiction, but the term is often used colloquially to refer to police acting dishonestly or in bad faith, as well as policing focused on anticipating and inducing crime, rather than responding to reports of crime." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Práctica mediante la cual la policía induce a personas LGBTQ+ a cometer acciones consideradas delitos que de otro modo no se habrían cometido o que era poco probable que se hubieran cometido." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001120> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002375" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police harassment of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acoso policial a personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> " Mistreatment of LGBTQ+ people by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Harassment of LGBTQ+ people by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police brutality toward LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police misconduct toward LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police mistreatment of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Maltrato hacia personas LGBTQ+ por la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Acoso de personas LGBtQ+ por la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Brutalidad policial hacia personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Mala conducta policial hacia personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Maltrato policial contra personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder que violentan directa o indirectamente a las personas LGBTQ+, incluidas, entre otras, confesiones forzadas, intimidación, arrestos y encarcelamientos falsos, falsificación de pruebas, perjurio policial, manipulación de testigos, brutalidad y corrupción policial, elaboración de caracterizaciones raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo, vigilancia injustificada, registros o incautación de propiedad, soborno o cabildeo para obtener poder o estatus excesivo o para evitar consecuencias, aplicación selectiva de la ley y conducta sexual inapropiada." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001121> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002376" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police harassment of Black LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acoso policial a personas LGBTQ+ negras" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against Black LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder que violentan directa o indirectamente a las personas LGBTQ+ negras, incluidas, entre otras, confesiones forzadas, intimidación, arrestos y encarcelamientos falsos, falsificación de pruebas, perjurio policial, manipulación de testigos, brutalidad y corrupción policial, elaboración de caracterizaciones raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo, vigilancia injustificada, registros o incautación de propiedad, soborno o cabildeo para obtener poder o estatus excesivo o para evitar consecuencias, aplicación selectiva de la ley y conducta sexual inapropiada." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000208> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002257> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002397> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002377" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police harassment of Indigenous LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acoso policial a personas LGBTQ+ indígenas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against Indigenous LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder que violentan directa o indirectamente a las personas LGBTQ+ indígenas, incluidas, entre otras, confesiones forzadas, intimidación, arrestos y encarcelamientos falsos, falsificación de pruebas, perjurio policial, manipulación de testigos, brutalidad y corrupción policial, elaboración de caracterizaciones raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo, vigilancia injustificada, registros o incautación de propiedad, soborno o cabildeo para obtener poder o estatus excesivo o para evitar consecuencias, aplicación selectiva de la ley y conducta sexual inapropiada." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002375> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000886> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002397> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002378" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police violence toward LGBTQ+ people " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Violencia policial hacia personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police abuse toward LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police torture of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Abuso policial contra personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Tortura policial contra personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any of various forms of police violence aimed toward LGBTQ+ people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cualquiera de las diversas formas de violencia policial dirigida hacia personas LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000059> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002395> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000059> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002379" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ criminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalización LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalización de personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of existing or identifying as an LGBTQ+ person, being perceived as LGBTQ+, or engaging in any of various actions considered to be linked to LGBTQ+ status." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La criminalización de una persona LGBTQ+ por existir o identificarse como tal, ser percibida como LGBTQ+ o participar de cualquiera de las diversas acciones consideradas vinculadas al estatus LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000314> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000356> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002380" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalization of homosexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalización de la homosexualidad" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of same-gender relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of same-sex relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalización de las relación del mismo género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalización de las relación del mismo sexo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of acts considered to be sexual or romantic between individuals perceived as being of the same gender category in a given sociocultural context." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La criminalización de actos considerados sexuales o románticos entre personas percibidas como de la misma categoría de género en un determinado contexto sociocultural." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002379> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001326> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-02-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002381" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+-related establishments" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con comunidades LGBTQ+|| \nRedadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con identidades LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-LGBTQ+ police raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ establishments" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ venues" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids to LGBTQ+ venues" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Redadas policiales anti-LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Redadas policiales en establecimientos LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Redadas policiales en lugares LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un registro no anunciado y sin orden judicial de una residencia o un establecimiento principalmente afiliado o relacionado con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+ por parte de la policía. Estos ataques suelen ser traumáticos y caóticos y pueden eludir los procedimientos penales típicos y las libertades civiles." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001735> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001741> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002382" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ bathhouses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales en saunas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Redadas policiales en casas de baño LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of bathouses, saunas, or spas owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Redadas policiales en baños, saunas, spas, etc. afiliados o relacionados con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000475> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002383" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ meeting places" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales en espacios de encuentro LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of meeting places owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people, including individuals' residences, businesses, and other institutions, by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Redadas policiales en lugares de encuentro afiliados o relacionados con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+, ya sea la residencia de una persona, un negocio u otra institución." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002384" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ bars" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales en bares LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of drinking establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Redadas policiales en bares afiliados o relacionados con comunidades e identidades LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000100> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002385" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ nightclubs" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Redadas policiales en clubs LGBTQ+|| \nRedadas policiales en clubes nocturnos LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of nightclubs owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Redadas policiales en clubes nocturnos afiliados o relacionados con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000909> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002386" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "No Police at Pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No Cops at Pride movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No Cops at Pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No Police at Pride movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Movimiento No Cops at Pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Moviento No Police at Pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Primarily Canadian and U.S. American movement wherein police officers were banned from LGBTQ+ pride events in some locations, due to historical and contemporary mistreatment of LGBTQ+ persons, especially Black and Indigenous LGBTQ+ persons. In recent years acted as a response to the 2010-2017 Toronto serial homicides and the mishandling of the investigation by the Toronto Police Service." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Movimiento principalmente canadiense y estadounidense en el que se le prohibió a agentes de policía participar en eventos del orgullo LGBTQ+ en algunos lugares, debido al maltrato histórico y contemporáneo hacia las personas LGBTQ+, especialmente las personas LGBTQ+ negras e indígenas. En los últimos años, fungió como respuesta a los homicidios en serie de Toronto de 2010-2017 y al mal manejo de la investigación por parte del Servicio Policial de Toronto." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003651> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-02-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
