<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002388" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalization of gender non-conformity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalización de la disidencia de género" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of any expression of gender considered to be nonconforming in a given sociocultural context." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La criminalización de cualquier expresión de género considerada disconforme en un determinado contexto sociocultural." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000314> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001922> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002389" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalization of cross-dressing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalización del transformismo" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of any expression of gender considered to be cross-dressing in a given sociocultural context." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La criminalización de cualquier expresión de género considerada transformismo en un determinado contexto sociocultural." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002388> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002390" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Defund the police movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Movimiento para desfinanciar a la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Defund the Police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Movement to defund police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Desfinanciación de la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Movimiento para desfinanciar la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Primarily a U.S. American and Canadian movement which supports divesting funds from, or abolition of, police departments (and often police structures generally) and reallocating them to non-policing forms of public safety and community support, such as social services, youth services, housing, education, healthcare and other community resources." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Principalmente, un movimiento estadounidense y canadiense que apoya la desinversión de fondos, o la abolición, de los departamentos de policía (y a menudo de las estructuras policiales en general) y su reasignación a formas no policiales de seguridad pública y apoyo comunitario, como los servicios sociales, los servicios para la juventud, la vivienda, la educación, los servicios médicos y otros recursos comunitarios." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002391" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police abolitionist movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Movimiento por la abolición de la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Abolishing the police movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Abolición de la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A primarily U.S. American and Canadian political movement that advocates replacing policing with other systems of public safety. Police abolitionists believe that policing, as a system, is inherently flawed and cannot be reformed—a view that rejects the ideology of police reformists. While reformists seek to address the ways in which policing occurs, abolitionists seek to transform policing altogether through a process of disbanding, disempowering, and disarming the police. Abolitionists argue that the institution of policing is deeply rooted in a history of white supremacy and settler colonialism and that it is inseparable from a pre-existing racial capitalist order, and thus believe a reformist approach to policing will always fail." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un movimiento político principalmente estadounidense y canadiense que aboga por reemplazar la vigilancia policial con otros sistemas de seguridad pública. Los abolicionistas policiales creen que la vigilancia policial, como sistema, es inherentemente defectuosa y no puede reformarse, una visión que rechaza la ideología de los reformistas policiales. Mientras los reformistas buscan abordar las formas en que se realiza la actividad policial, los abolicionistas buscan transformarla por completo a través de un proceso de disolución, desempoderamiento y desarme de la policía. Los abolicionistas argumentan que la institución policial está profundamente arraigada en una historia de supremacía blanca y asentamiento colonial y que es inseparable de un orden capitalista racial preexistente y, por lo tanto, creen que un enfoque reformista de la policía siempre fracasará." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002390> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002392" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identificación de personas LGBTQ+ por la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people, or people believed to be LGBTQ+, by police using any of various tools and mechanisms, many of which are pseudoscientific in nature. Such data is then used to entrap and prosecute LGBTQ+ persons, especially in areas where being LGBTQ+ is still criminalized." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identificación de personas LGBTQ+, o personas que se cree que son LGBTQ+, por parte de la policía utilizando cualquiera de diversas herramientas y mecanismos, muchas de los cuales son de naturaleza pseudocientífica. Luego, esos datos se utilizan para atrapar y procesar a personas LGBTQ+, especialmente en áreas donde ser LGBTQ+ todavía está criminalizado." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001065> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002373> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-01-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002393" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Digital identification of LGBTQ+ people by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identificación digital de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de la policía" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Digital stop and search to identify LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people by police using phone data" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police use of digital tools to identify LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Detenciones y registros digitales para identificar a personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Identificación de personas LGBTQ+ por la policía mediante datos telefónicos" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Uso policial de herramientas digitales para identificar a personas LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people, or people believed to be LGBTQ+, by police using digital tools, such as phone records, mobile applications, facial identification algorithms, and artificial intelligence technologies. Such data is then used to entrap and prosecute LGBTQ+ persons, especially in areas where being LGBTQ+ is still criminalized." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identificación de personas LGBTQ+, o personas que se cree que son LGBTQ+, por parte de la policía utilizando herramientas digitales, como registros telefónicos, aplicaciones móviles, algoritmos de identificación facial y tecnologías de inteligencia artificial. Luego, esos datos se utilizan para atrapar y procesar a personas LGBTQ+, especialmente en áreas donde ser LGBTQ+ aún está criminalizado." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002392> .
