<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002462> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Past events or accounts of the past concerning aromantic people, or people who might be perceived as aromantic if they were alive today.\t\t\t\t" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002462> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hechos o relatos del pasado relacionados con personas arrománticas, o personas que pudiesen ser percibidas como arrománticas si vivieran hoy en día." .
