<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002463> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accounts of aromantic peoples' lives written by those people. For written accounts of aromantic people's lives that were not written by the subject, use \"Aromantic biographies.\"\t\t" .
