<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002513> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The study, evaluation, and interpretation of literary works focusing on megasexual characters or themes; can also include interpretation of literature through the lens and frameworks of megasexual studies.\t\t\t\t" .
