<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002520> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written literary works about imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements; use in reference to science fiction focusing on greyromantic characters or themes.\t\t\t\t" .
