<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002568" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-binary horror fiction" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ficción de horror no binaria" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written works of fiction intended to frighten, scare, or disgust; use in reference to horror fiction focusing on non-binary characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras de ficción escritas con la intención de asustar, atemorizar o provocar disgusto; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de horror centrada en personajes o temas no binarios." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001580> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002565> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345> .
