<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-binary erotic literature" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Literatura erótica no binaria" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002572> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Literary works that have erotic or sexual elements; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on non-binary characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002572> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras literarias que tengan elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a la literatura erótica que se centra en personajes o temas no binarios." .
