<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002574> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002574> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002575" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-binary comics" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cómics no binarios" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Historietas no binarias" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in reference to comics focusing on non-binary characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras que consisten en imágenes secuenciales, a menudo acompañadas de texto; utilícese en referencia a cómics que se centran en personajes o temas no binarios." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000841> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002576" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-binary poetry" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Poesía no binaria" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on non-binary characters, themes, or identity." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades no binarias." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001118> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002577" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queercrip" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cripqueer" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A portmanteau of two reclaimed terms (queer and crip) used to indicate that a person or a thing belongs to both queer and crip communities, often used to indicate unity or shared struggles. This term may also appear as \"cripqueer\" to emphasize the crip identity before the queer one.\t\t\t\t" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La unión de dos términos reclamados (\"queer\" y \"crip\") utilizados para indicar que una persona o cosa pertenece tanto a comunidades queer como crip, a menudo utilizado para indicar unidad o luchas compartidas. Este término también puede aparecer como \"cripqueer\" para enfatizar la identidad crip antes que la queer." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001559> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001149> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001195> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001854> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001879> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001891> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001317> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002578" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "69ing " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hacer el 69" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "69'ing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "69-ing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "69" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sixty-Nining" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Posición 69" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "69ing refers to an act of shared oral sex between two people simultaneously giving and receiving oral sex, said to look similar to the number 69." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "69ing se refiere a un acto de sexo oral compartido entre dos personas, una encima de la otra, que dan y reciben sexo oral simultáneamente. Se dice que la posición se parece al número 69." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000593> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000212> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000239> .
