<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002580" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Appropriation of Indigenous identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Apropiación de identidades indígenas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Pretendians" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of cultural appropriation and race shifting involving false claims of citizenship, belonging, and/or descent from Indigenous people in North America. Not to be confused with disconnected or reconnecting descendants." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de apropiación cultural y cambio racial que implica afirmaciones falsas de ciudadanía, pertenencia y/o ascendencia de pueblos indígenas de Norteamérica. No se debe confundir con descendientes desconectados o reconectados." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002581" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Appropriation of Two-Spirit identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Apropiación de identidades dos espíritus" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of cultural appropriation involving identification with Two-Spirit identity by people who cannot claim citizenship, belonging, and/or descent from Indigenous people in North America." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una forma de apropiación cultural que implica la identificación con la identidad Dos Espíritus por parte de personas que no pueden reclamar ciudadanía, pertenencia y/o descendencia de pueblos indígenas de Norteamérica." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001914> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002582" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Appropriation of marginalized identities" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Apropiación de identidades marginadas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Falsely claiming belonging to a marginalized group (including, but not limited to: disability, ethnicity, race, and sexuality)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Afirmar falsamente pertenecer a un grupo marginado (incluyendo, pero no limitado a: la discapacidad, el origen étnico, la raza y la sexualidad)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002580> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002583" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queerspawn " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queerspawn" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People with one or more queer parent or caregiver, usually for self-identification. Queerspawn is believed to have been coined in 1995 or 1996 by Stefan Lynch for use in zine published by COLAGE, a U.S. based organization dedicated to supporting people with one or more LGBTQ+ caregiver." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas con uno o más padres o cuidadores queer, generalmente utilizado para autoidentificarse. Se cree que Queerspawn fue acuñado en 1995 o 1996 por Stefan Lynch para utilizarlo en un zine publicado por COLAGE, una organización con sede en EE. UU. dedicada a apoyar a las personas con uno o más cuidadores LGBTQ+." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000260> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001317> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000262> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001176> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001194> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000421> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002584" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bothies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who have two or more LGBTQ+ parents or caregivers. Includes individuals born to or adopted by people in a heterosexual relationship who later came out as LGBTQ+, as well as individuals born to or adopted by LGBTQ+ people who came together to create their own families, such as lesbian couples who choose to conceive with friends who are gay men. For use in a Canadian and United States context." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas que tienen dos o más padres o cuidadores LGBTQ+. Incluye a personas nacidas o adoptadas por personas en una relación heterosexual que luego se declararon LGBTQ+, así como personas nacidas o adoptadas por personas LGBTQ+ que se unieron para crear sus propias familias, como parejas de lesbianas que eligen concebir con amigos que son hombres gay. Utilícese en contextos canadienses y estadounidenses." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000260> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001317> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000420> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001075> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000421> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002584> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
