<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hijos LGBTQ+ de padres y madres LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Second generation (LGBTQ+ families)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Segunda generación (familias LGBTQ+)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002585> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe people who are LGBTQ+ and have at least one LGBTQ+ parent or caregiver." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002585> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Término utilizado para describir a las personas que son LGBTQ+ y que tienen al menos un padre o cuidador LGBTQ+." .
