<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Generaciones familiares LGBTQ+" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002586> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Refers to families with LGBTQ+ individuals in multiple generations." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002586> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Se refiere a familias con personas LGBTQ+ en varias generaciones." .
