<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002620> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process by which donated sperm is placed inside a person with a uterus to induce pregnancy." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002620> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El proceso mediante el cual se coloca esperma donado dentro de una persona con útero para inducir el embarazo." .
