<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002658> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002658" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ neurodivergent people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personas LGBTQ+ neurodivergentes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002658> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people whose brains process, learn, and/or behave differently from what is considered typical by society. Some of these neurological differences can present as learning disabilities, medical disorders, and other conditions." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002658> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas LGBTQ+ cuyos cerebros procesan, aprenden y/o se comportan de manera diferente a lo que la sociedad considera típico. Algunas de estas diferencias neurológicas pueden presentarse como problemas de aprendizaje, trastornos médicos y otras condiciones." .
