<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002663> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Queer people whose brains process, learn, and/or behave differently from what is considered typical by society. Some of these neurological differences can present as learning disabilities, medical disorders, and other conditions." .
