<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002686> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written literary works that are short in length and detail a self-contained incident or concept; use in reference to short stories focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002686> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Obras literarias escritas que son breves y detallan un incidente o concepto autónomo; utilícese en referencia a historias cortas que se centren en personajes o temas dos espíritus." .
