<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002889> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002889" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgender operas" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óperas transgénero" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002889> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Operas created by transgender directors, depicting transgender individuals, or that are regarded as important within transgender culture." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002889> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Óperas creadas por directores transgénero, que representan a personas transgénero o que se consideran importantes dentro de la cultura transgénero." .
