<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002897> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Latin American people who are asexual; only use to describe individuals who self-identify as Latino, Latina, or Latinx. Do not conflate with Chicano/a/x or Hispanic." .
