<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersex newsletters" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Boletines intersex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002918> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Serialized print or digital periodicals created by or for intersex people, often with the purpose of sharing news and information related to intersex communities and intersex issues." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002918> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Publicaciones periódicas impresas o digitales serializadas creadas por o para personas intersex, a menudo con el propósito de compartir noticias e información relacionada con comunidades intersex y cuestiones intersex." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001041> .
