<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Asexual Native Hawaiians" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Indigenous Hawaiian asexual people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Native Hawaiian asexual people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asexual people who are part of the Indigenous people of Mokupuni o Hawai‘i, or the Hawaiian Islands; only use to refer to people who identify as Kanaka Maoli." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas asexuales que pertenecen al pueblo indígena mokupuni o hawai‘i, o a las islas hawaianas. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se identifiquen como kānaka maoli." .
