<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "American Indian asexual people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Asexual American Indians" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Asexual Native Americans" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Personas nativoamericanas asexuales" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who are part of the Native peoples of the continental United States and Canada (excluding Inuit people) and self-identity as asexual. Use more specific terms when available." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002925> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas asexuales que son nativoamericanas o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Norteamérica; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como nativoamericanas y asexuales." .
