<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003025> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Greyromantic people who have long-term health conditions that require continued medical attention and/or significantly impact or limit daily life; some but not all people with chronic illnesses consider themselves disabled." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003025> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personas grisrománticas que tienen condiciones de salud a largo plazo que requieren atención médica continua y/o impactan o limitan significativamente la vida diaria; algunas, pero no todas, las personas con enfermedades crónicas se consideran discapacitadas." .
