<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mordaza" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ball gags" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ballgags" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An item or device used to prevent speech, usually by blocking or filling the mouth. Often used in some forms of bondage play." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un artículo o dispositivo utilizado para impedir el habla." .
