<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003091" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lateral oppression" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Opresión lateral" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lateral violence" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenomenon in which someone in a marginalized group displaces violence or oppression onto other members of their own group, often by acting on internalized oppressive beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward any marginalized identities they hold) adopted as a result of being raised or socialized within an oppressive environment or culture." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El fenómeno a través del cual una persona de un grupo marginado desplaza la violencia u opresión hacia otros miembros de su propio grupo, a menudo, actuando sobre la base de creencias opresivas internalizadas (es decir, percepciones negativas e intolerancia hacia cualquier identidad marginada que tengan), adoptadas como resultado de haber sido criadas o socializadas dentro de un entorno o una cultura opresiva." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003092> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003093> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003094> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003095> .
