<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Open marriage" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003278> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of consensual non-monogamy in which spouses agree to engage in sexual and/or romantic relationships with individuals other than their marriage partner, without regarding this as infidelity." .
