<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Child sexual abuse materials" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003433> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Images and videos that show children and youth who are under the age of consent engaged in sexual activities. While this term is not otherwise within the scope of the Homosaurus vocabulary, it is provided as an alternative to commonly used terms such as \"Child pornography\" in order to highlight that the production of such materials is a direct product of and contributes to the sexual abuse of children." .
