<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003444> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in gender studies and feminist writing to describe a setting or culture in which sexual violence is pervasive and normalized due to attitudes about gender and sexuality." .
