<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003445> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used to describe the phenomena of heterosexual or hetero-presenting individuals expressing curiosity about exploring sexual relationships or experiences with other people of the same gender." .
