<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-transgender law-making" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Efforts to propose, enact, amend, or strike down laws as a means of restricting the legal rights of transgender people. This includes legislation regarding access to gender-affirming healthcare, participation in sporting events, administrative and judicial procedures such as sex and name registration, and policies affecting the medical treatment, education, and mental health care of transgender youth." .
