<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Turkey baster babies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003501> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Babies conceived through at-home artificial insemination, specifically by injecting semen into one's vagina using a turkey baster. There is an extensive history of at-home artificial insemination undertaken by LGBTQ+ people, including gay men contributing semen to aid lesbian couples in conceiving." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000255> .
