<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Questioning" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003509> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used to describe individuals who are in the process of determining their sexual orientation and/or gender identity. " .
