<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pride parades" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ pride parades" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003652> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Processions of LGBTQ+ people and allies, usually organized along a public street, that recognize and celebrate LGBTQ+ people and culture. For political marches and rallies, use the term \"LGBTQ+ demonstrations.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003651> .
