<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003653" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Pride (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, thereby affirming the visibility, dignity, and diversity of LGBTQ+ communities." .
