<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> .
