<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003655> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003655" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgender pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Trans pride" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003655> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The recognition and celebration of transgender people and culture, thereby affirming the visibility, dignity, and diversity of transgender communities." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003653> .
