<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003656" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ History Month" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gay History Month" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An annual, month-long observance of LGBTQ+ history and related civil rights movements. The month in which LGBTQ+ History Month is observed differs depending on the country." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000861> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002260> .
