<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003660> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Benevolent fictional characters who possess superhuman powers or abilities beyond those of ordinary people which they use to fight evil and help the public. Use to refer to superheroes who are explicitly identified as LGBTQ+ within their source material." .
