<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003691> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003691" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gentrification" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003691> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process of economic and demographic change within a historically disinvested neighborhood by means of real estate investment and an influx of new, higher-income residents, typically resulting in the displacement of long-time, lower-income residents." .
