<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003693> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Public spaces designated as safe for, or accepting and affirming of, LGBTQ+ people, often by allies. LGBTQ+ safe spaces are sometimes identified through the display of stickers or placards." .
