<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003742> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The trade and exploitation of human beings through force, fraud, and/or coercion, often with the intention of compelling the individual to provide sexual services or other forms of labor against their will." .
