<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Pole-dancing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Peeling" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Stripteasing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Exotic dancing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of sex work that involves undressing to music while using a pole to perform dance moves, whether in a venue like a strip club or by hire at private parties. Stripping may also be performed by amateurs in private settings." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001276> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001343> .
