<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
