<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003765" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anti-sex work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti sex work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-sex-work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of feminism that alleges that sex work is inherently coercive and exploitative. Although not all sex workers are women and not all clients are men, anti-sex work feminism largely centers this gender dynamic, viewing sex work as a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 4.1.0" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003766" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "SWERFs" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work exclusionary radical feminists" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex worker exclusionary radical feminists" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An acronym for \"sex work-exclusionary radical feminists,\" this term refers to people who subscribe to a subset of radical feminism that rejects sex worker rights and solidarity with sex workers under the belief that sex work is antithetical to their ideology and inherently perpetuates oppression against women." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003177> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765> .
