<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti pornography feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti porn feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003767> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of feminism that alleges that pornography is a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy and is thus inherently violent and exploitative." .
