<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003772" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sex work legislation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work laws" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution legislation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution laws" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Laws and regulations addressing the practice, solitiation, and/or facilitation of sex work, including its legality. Legislation may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers." .
