<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalisation of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work criminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of prostitution" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution criminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process by which the practice and solicitation of sex work is made criminal, typically by introducing laws, regulations, and criminal penalties. Efforts to criminalize sex work often target street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work." .
