<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Harm reduction (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003789> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of practical strategies and ideas aimed at reducing the negative impacts of sex work on sex workers, as well as a social justice movement advocating for the rights of sex workers." .
