<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sex worker rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex workers' rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Rights of sex workers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitute rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitutes' rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Rights of prostitutes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom or entitlement held by or pursued by sex workers. This includes, but is not limited to, human rights, health rights, freedom from discrimination and prejudice, and labor rights." .
