<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003792" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sugaring" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sugar dating" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of sex work in which companionship and sexual services are exchanged for money, gifts, and other material benefits. Generally but not always sugaring describes a relationship between an older client and a younger sex worker." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001276> .
