<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003793> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003793" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sugar babies" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003793> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who provide companionship and sexual services to sugar mamas or daddies in exchange for money, gifts, and other material benefits." .
